    "about.p3": "By using data and information, building scientific evidence, innovating, and working across sectors, CHARIS aims to produce recommendations and solutions that are practical, measurable, and sustainable. Its work covers policy and governance, financing, resources, technology, service quality, institutional development, and health system capacity.",
    "about.vision": "Vision", "about.vision.d": "To be a leading, innovative, and collaborative center for health analysis, research, and service development that supports health systems that are high quality, resilient, inclusive, and sustainable.",
