    "privacy.body": "This page explains what data we collect through the CHARIS website and how we use it.\n\nData we collect. When you fill in the contact form, we store your name, organization, email, phone number, service of interest, and message. When you subscribe to CHARIS updates, we store your email address.\n\nHow we use it. Contact form data is used only to respond to your request. Subscriber emails are used only to send CHARIS news and publications. We do not sell or share your data with others for marketing.\n\nStorage. Data is stored in a Google Spreadsheet owned by Yayasan Peduli Insan Rentan and can only be accessed by CHARIS staff.\n\nYour rights. You can ask for a copy, correction, or deletion of your data, or unsubscribe at any time, by contacting us at halo@charisforhealth.org.\n\nThis page may be updated from time to time. Last updated: November 2026."
